{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_plan", "label": "Plan 1 Part 2", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Continues the core pipeline plan with the Jev and Gemini classifiers, cascade combine rules, span-anchored extraction, transaction lookup, and routing. The header, global constraints, and review focus from part 1 apply here too."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_jev_classifier", "label": "JevClassifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One main call asks category, priority, six flags, and candidate picks. A second call repeats category with the options reversed to catch position bias. Unknown categories become other and uncertain. Low top probability, low confidence, or an order disagreement also marks the ticket uncertain."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_gemini_classifier", "label": "GeminiClassifier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-consistency over three samples at temperature 0.7. Confidence is the share of samples that agree on a taxonomy label. Invalid categories do not vote. A verbatim span that is not in the ticket is rejected so the model cannot invent a value."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_cascade_combine", "label": "Cascade Combine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jev runs first, Gemini runs when Jev is unsure, and a human gets what is still uncertain. Gemini below T_GEM yields gemini_fallback with low_confidence. A confident Gemini that disagrees with Jev at or above 0.4 yields classifier_disagreement. Missing Jev degrades to Gemini. Missing Gemini keeps Jev. Both missing raises LLMUnavailable. A Jev pick at confidence 0.5 or higher beats the Gemini pick."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_span_extraction", "label": "Span-Anchored Extraction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "finalize anchors every value to a span and normalizes reference, amount, phone, and date in code. fill_gaps calls Gemini only for weak required fields, and a Gemini failure leaves the original extraction. A value that was not stated is null. This implements spec section 6.3."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_transaction_lookup", "label": "Transaction Lookup", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Categories that do not need a transaction return not_applicable. Otherwise an exact reference is tried first, then phone plus amount within 1 percent and a three-day window. Several hits stay ambiguous unless a counterpart phone narrows them. Amount and date mismatches are separate statuses."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_routing_rules", "label": "Routing and Escalation Rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Team comes from the category. fraud_suspected above 0.5 forces P1. money_lost above 0.5 raises priority to at least P2, then the category minimum applies. Any reason escalates the ticket and note_for writes a one-line reviewer note. Empty tickets escalate as empty_ticket at P4 without a model call."}], "edges": [{"source": "data_taxonomy_failed_transfer", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_taxonomy_wrong_recipient", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_taxonomy_agent_dispute", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_taxonomy_bill_payment", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "data_taxonomy_refund_request", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_lookup", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_jev_classifier", "target": "data_taxonomy_taxonomy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_jev_classifier", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_jev_classify", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_gemini_classifier", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_stage2_classify_prompts_gemini_classify_v1_prompt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_gemini_classifier", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_runner_gemini_classify", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_span_extraction", "target": "backend_app_pipeline_stage2_classify_prompts_gemini_extract_v1_prompt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-07-plan1-core-pipeline-part2.md", "source_location": "Task 7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_cascade_combine", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_10_07_plan1_core_pipeline_part2_jev_classifier", "relation": 